OL,3,GNEWSA'Culture of fear' putting NHS
OL,4,AGrampian patients at risk, say health
OL,5,Aexperts
OL,6,
OL,7,FCover-ups and a "culture of fear and
OL,8,Fblame" are putting patient safety at
OL,9,Frisk in NHS Grampian, according to
OL,10,Fleading healthcare professionals.
OL,12,FScotland's patient safety commissioner
OL,13,Fand the previous chairman of BMA
OL,14,FScotland made the remarks in the wake
OL,15,Fof a damning report about senior
OL,16,Fleadership failings in the health
OL,17,Fboard.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
