OL,3,GNEWSA'Culture of fear' putting NHS
OL,4,AGrampian patients at risk, say health
OL,5,Aexperts
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe report revealed that a failure to
OL,8,Flearn from mistakes had caused
OL,9,F"repeated and unavoidable harm" to
OL,10,Fpatients, and that one hospital
OL,11,Fcontinued to operate on children
OL,12,Fdespite an order to halt all paediatric
OL,13,Fsurgery.
OL,15,FHealth Secretary Angela Constance
OL,16,Finsisted that patients were safe. She
OL,17,Fsaid she would demand "full
OL,18,Ftransparency" at every level.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
